ground pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">My presumably scrotum.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/b/b5/My_presumably_scrotum..png/revision/latest?cb=20250516092249\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"My presumably scrotum.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/b/b5/My_presumably_scrotum..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250516092249\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/b/b5/My_presumably_scrotum..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250516092249 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/b/b5/My_presumably_scrotum..png/revision/latest?cb=20250516092249 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"My presumably scrotum.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"My_presumably_scrotum..png\" data-image-name=\"My presumably scrotum..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_19\" title=\"Series 19\">19</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\">Mathew Baynton</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/An_invisible_jump_rope.\" title=\"An invisible jump rope.\">An invisible jump rope.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Midnight_picnic.\" title=\"Midnight picnic.\">Midnight picnic.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>My presumably scrotum.</b></i> is the third episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_19\" title=\"Series 19\">Series 19</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 15 May 2025. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\">Mathew Baynton</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/My_presumably_scrotum.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2><p>\nAfter the VT of <a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\">Mathew Baynton</a> crawling on the floor with his crotch pixelated was shown for the <a href=\"/wiki/Answer_the_cheese_phone\" title=\"Answer the cheese phone\">Answer the cheese phone</a> task, he states that he didn't intend on \"upstaging\" <a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\">Stevie Martin</a> with \"[his], presumably, scrotum\". The title card shows paint from the <a href=\"/wiki/Paint_the_best_picture_of_the_Taskmaster_and_his_assistant_having_fun_on_the_canvas_in_the_lab\" title=\"Paint the best picture of the Taskmaster and his assistant having fun on the canvas in the lab\">Paint the best picture of the Taskmaster and his assistant having fun on the canvas in the lab</a> task surrounded by cheeses, with the cheese referencing the cheese phone task.</p><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/My_presumably_scrotum.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"line-height: 1;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align: top; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 0 5px 5px 5px;\">&#8220;\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1.5;\"><i>The contestants are released from the Taskmaster grounds to explore an old abbey, but <a href=\"/wiki/Fatiha_El-Ghorri\" title=\"Fatiha El-Ghorri\">Fatiha El-Ghorri</a> is concerned about the aggressive waterfowl. Despite <a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Ramsey\" title=\"Rosie Ramsey\">Rosie Ramsey</a> going flying, <a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\">Stevie Martin</a> attempting art with a duck and <a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\">Jason Mantzoukas</a> finding a new moustache, it's <a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\">Mathew Baynton</a> crawling through a corridor that causes the largest commotion.</i>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 5px 5px -3px 5px;\">&#8221;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\">- British Comedy Guide\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><small><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.comedy.co.uk/tv/taskmaster/episodes/19/3/\">[1]</a></small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Fatiha_El-Ghorri\" title=\"Fatiha El-Ghorri\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Fatiha El-Ghorri</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jason Mantzoukas</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mathew Baynton</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Ramsey\" title=\"Rosie Ramsey\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rosie Ramsey</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Stevie Martin</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_thing_for_a_middle-aged_man_to_keep_on_his_bedside_table\" title=\"Best thing for a middle-aged man to keep on his bedside table\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best thing for a middle-aged man to keep on his bedside table.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Answer_the_cheese_phone\" title=\"Answer the cheese phone\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Answer the cheese phone. Every time you move, Alex will play the French horn. If you choose to only use your sense of smell, Alex will not play the French horn and your final time 